      <div class="section-20">
        <div class="container-1280">
          <h2 data-w-id="6341893c-46cc-bdb0-793e-fdc3bb064b79" style="opacity:0" class="h2-prix left">Questions we're asked about<span class="gradient-text"> cash registers:</span></h2>
          <div class="w-layout-grid faq-solutions prix">
            <div id="w-node-_6341893c-46cc-bdb0-793e-fdc3bb064b7e-6643cbb2" data-w-id="6341893c-46cc-bdb0-793e-fdc3bb064b7e" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
              <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
                <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions">How much does a touch-sensitive cash register cost?</h3>
                <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                  <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
                <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Innovorder's touchscreen POS solutions are available starting at €79/month (excluding hardware). This offer includes one NF525-certified POS terminal. To receive personalized support and a customized quote, contact an Innovorder advisor.<br></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div id="w-node-_6341893c-46cc-bdb0-793e-fdc3bb064b89-6643cbb2" data-w-id="6341893c-46cc-bdb0-793e-fdc3bb064b89" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
              <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
                <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions">How do I install a cash register?</h3>
                <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                  <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
                <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Our experts take care of everything! Our team comes to your restaurant to install, set up and train you to use the cash register. All you need is a power cable and an Internet connection.<br></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div id="w-node-_6341893c-46cc-bdb0-793e-fdc3bb064b94-6643cbb2" data-w-id="6341893c-46cc-bdb0-793e-fdc3bb064b94" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
              <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
                <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions">Is it compulsory to have a cash register?</h3>
                <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                  <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
                <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Since January 1, 2018, all VAT-registered restaurants recording customer payments using cash register software have been required to use secure, certified equipment in order to combat VAT fraud.<br><br>The law therefore does not require restaurant professionals to equip themselves with cash register software or systems or cash registers.<br></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div id="w-node-_6341893c-46cc-bdb0-793e-fdc3bb064b9f-6643cbb2" data-w-id="6341893c-46cc-bdb0-793e-fdc3bb064b9f" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
              <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
                <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions">How do you choose the right cash register for your restaurant?</h3>
                <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                  <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
                <div class="accordion-text---solutions">To choose the cash register that best suits your restaurant's needs, it's important to check a whole range of criteria: the size of your establishment, the volume of sales, your budget, your sales volume, NF 525 certification, the functions that are essential to your day-to-day operation, how easy it is for you and your staff to get to grips with the cash register, the reliability of the provider and the integrations it offers. For expert advice, contact us!<br></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div id="w-node-_6341893c-46cc-bdb0-793e-fdc3bb064baa-6643cbb2" data-w-id="6341893c-46cc-bdb0-793e-fdc3bb064baa" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
              <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
                <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions">Does Innovorder work offline?</h3>
                <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                  <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
                <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Because there's nothing more unpleasant than losing your Internet connection in the middle of a rush, our Innovorder cash register lets you cash your customers even when you're offline.<br></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div id="w-node-_079ba702-146f-1bf4-c26e-0a326aea3eb6-6643cbb2" data-w-id="079ba702-146f-1bf4-c26e-0a326aea3eb6" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
              <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
                <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Can I customize my cash register interface?</strong></h3>
                <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                  <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
                <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Our tills offer a wide range of customization options, so you can tailor them to your specific needs. For example, you can adapt the touch plan of your cash register to the specific needs of your restaurant, by modifying menus, categories and products.<br></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div id="w-node-_204841b9-bc50-c52f-7580-a8824c39eab6-6643cbb2" data-w-id="204841b9-bc50-c52f-7580-a8824c39eab6" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
              <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
                <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Does the cash register comply with current tax regulations?</strong></h3>
                <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                  <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
                <div class="accordion-text---solutions">All our cash registers and cash register software have complied with the NF 525 standard since 2016. A certificate issued by Afnor guarantees that Innovorder cash registers comply with the law on the fight against VAT fraud in the event of an inspection by the tax authorities.<br></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div id="w-node-db413bcd-9865-c2a5-52db-e027e92bf672-6643cbb2" data-w-id="db413bcd-9865-c2a5-52db-e027e92bf672" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
              <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
                <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>What are the advantages of a cash register?</strong></h3>
                <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                  <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
                <div class="accordion-text---solutions">A connected cash register allows you to:<br>‍<br></div>
                <ul role="list" class="bullets-expertise-block _17">
                  <li>Save time on collection and order management</li>
                  <li>Reduce data entry errors</li>
                  <li>Centralize all your sales and optimize your financial tracking</li>
                  <li>Simplify inventory management and sales reports</li>
                  <li>Enhance the customer experience with fast, seamless checkout</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div id="w-node-e1fbdb9d-d2ab-b119-b220-bc8dbede15a7-6643cbb2" data-w-id="e1fbdb9d-d2ab-b119-b220-bc8dbede15a7" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
              <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
                <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>What are the main criteria for choosing a cash register?</strong></h3>
                <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                  <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
                <div class="accordion-text---solutions">The main criterion is to match your needs. Your cash register must be adapted to your type of restaurant (fast food, traditional, food court, etc.), be intuitive for your teams and offer essential functionalities (order management, integrated payment, connection to kiosks, sales tracking, etc.).<br></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div id="w-node-_87d3549e-e9ff-dd80-eee1-335b0640d3f6-6643cbb2" data-w-id="87d3549e-e9ff-dd80-eee1-335b0640d3f6" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
              <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
                <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>How do you choose the right cash register for your restaurant?</strong></h3>
                <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                  <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
                <div class="accordion-text---solutions">To help you make the right choice, take the following into account:<br>‍<br></div>
                <ul role="list" class="bullets-expertise-block _17">
                  <li>Ease of use and ergonomics</li>
                  <li>Features (order management, payment, loyalty, etc.)</li>
                  <li>Compatibility with your existing tools (kiosks, delivery platforms, management software)</li>
                  <li>Compliance with tax legislation (NF525 certification)</li>
                  <li>Availability of customer support and software updates</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div id="w-node-c9850111-6491-0387-56c5-c45b980a9dff-6643cbb2" data-w-id="c9850111-6491-0387-56c5-c45b980a9dff" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
