  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
                <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Yes, all our Innovorder tills are synchronized with our order terminals. This streamlines the customer experience and automatically sends orders to the kitchen for faster, more efficient service.<br></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div id="w-node-_86ff31b9-21a7-e4c0-d716-320d0f52879b-6643cbb2" data-w-id="86ff31b9-21a7-e4c0-d716-320d0f52879b" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
              <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
                <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Can I join a loyalty program?</strong></h3>
