  </svg></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
                <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Yes, our checkouts are compatible with the Splio loyalty program.<br></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div id="w-node-_0ed39e29-103d-a9df-0627-72758f7e93ac-6643cbb2" data-w-id="0ed39e29-103d-a9df-0627-72758f7e93ac" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
              <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
                <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>What are the different Innovorder cases?</strong></h3>
