                  <li>Innovorder Move: a flexible cash register, perfect for dynamic restaurants</li>
                  <li>Innovorder Pro: a complete solution for facilities requiring advanced management</li>
                  <li>Innovorder Max: high-performance and robust, ideal for busy restaurants</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
