              <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
                <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Yes, all sales data is accessible in real time from the back office, enabling instant analysis of performance and optimized decision-making.<br></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div id="w-node-f79b5e15-f7e5-e88a-5840-8290b6082187-6643cbb2" data-w-id="f79b5e15-f7e5-e88a-5840-8290b6082187" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
